## User

Apply a function to every value in a tree, keeping its shape.

## Context

```haskell
data Tree a = Leaf | Node (Tree a) a (Tree a)
```

## Type

type
```haskell
mapTree :: (a -> b) -> Tree a -> Tree b
```

## Term

```haskell
mapTree f (Leaf) = Leaf
mapTree f (Node l x r) = Node (mapTree f l) (f x) (mapTree f r)
```

